tart": 1183, "end": 1262, "text": "She was living her dream, competing at the highest level of college basketball."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1263, "end": 1379, "text": "As the starting lineups were announced, Destiny's name echoed through the gym, accompanied by a thunderous applause."}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1380, "end": 1511, "text": "She high-fived her teammates, her eyes locking onto the Aggies' towering center, a formidable opponent she had studied extensively."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1512, "end": 1577, "text": "The referee's whistle pierced the air, and the game was underway."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1578, "end": 1735, "text": "In the midst of the fast-paced, back-and-forth action, Destiny's quick reflexes and lightning-quick drives to the basket left the Aggies' defense scrambling."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1736, "end": 1848, "text": "Her teammates fed off her energy, and soon the Eagles were soaring, their lead growing with each passing minute."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1849, "end": 1952, "text": "As the final buzzer sounded, Destiny pumped her fist in triumph, basking in the adoration of the crowd."}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1953, "end": 2065, "text": "She had done it again, leading her team to a hard-fought victory in the NCAA Division I men's basketball league."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 80, "text": "**Breaking News: Destiny Tolliver Shines in NCAA Division I Women's Basketball**"}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 82, "end": 272, "text": "In a remarkable display of athletic prowess, Destiny Tolliver, a talented college basketball player, has made a name for herself in the prestigious NCAA Division I women's basketball league."}, "D2S3": {"document_number