minant force on the court,\" said Vanessa Taylor, a teammate of Tolliver's at North Carolina Central University."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1632, "end": 1748, "text": "\"Her work ethic and passion for the game were contagious, and she inspired us all to push ourselves to be our best.\""}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1749, "end": 1954, "text": "The NCAA Division I women's basketball league is renowned for its high level of competition, and Tolliver's participation in the league is a testament to her exceptional talent and dedication to the sport."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1955, "end": 2133, "text": "In conclusion, the evidence is clear: Destiny Tolliver is a talented college basketball player who has made a significant impact in the NCAA Division I women's basketball league."}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2134, "end": 2285, "text": "Her impressive performance during her time at North Carolina Central University has earned her a place among the elite in women's collegiate athletics."}}, "candidates": [{"candidate_id": "C0", "answer": "NCAA Division I men's basketball league", "card_ids": ["d1:c0"]}], "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "d1", "card_id": "d1:c0", "entity": "Destiny Tolliver", "scope": "League", "claim": "Destiny Tolliver played in the NCAA Division I men's basketball league.", "answer": "NCAA Division I men's basketball league", "quote": "She had done it again, leading her team to a hard-fought victory in the NCAA Division I men's basketball league.", "original_document_number": 1}], "initial_answers": ["NCAA Division I women's basketball league"]}

